(Chile 2001)_01,IM_OVERSIGHT,False,,True,1.0,"Article 11 b) The commencement of activities of written media outlets shall be reported to the Provincial Governor's Office or Regional Intendancy corresponding to the domicile of the medium by means of a declaration, of which that Governor's Office or Intendancy shall send a copy to the Director of the National Library. The declaration shall contain the following statements: b) The full name, profession, domicile and the documents proving the identity of the owner, if they are a natural person, or of the persons who have the legal representation of the company, if it is a legal person;"
