(Malawi 2023)_01,C_EXPRESS_ORDER,False,,True,1.0,"217B.—(2) any person who aids, abets or attempts to carry out a terrorist act commits an offence and shall, upon conviction, be liable to imprisonment for life.

217D. any person who solicits, acquires or possesses any property intending that it be used, or for knowing that it may be used in whole or in part, to carry out a terrorist act, commits an offence and shall, upon conviction, be liable to imprisonment for life.

217E. any person who knowingly recruits or facilitates the recruitment of another person— (a) to be a member of a terrorist organization; commits an offence and shall, upon conviction, be liable to imprisonment for life.

217E. any person who knowingly recruits or facilitates the recruitment of another person— (b) to carry out a terrorist act, commits an offence and shall, upon conviction, be liable to imprisonment for life.

217F.—(1) any person who provides or facilitates the training of a member of a terrorist organization or any other person— (a) intending that the knowledge and skills acquired be used to carry out a terrorist act, commits an offence and shall, upon conviction, be liable to imprisonment for life.

217F.—(1) any person who provides or facilitates the training of a member of a terrorist organization or any other person— (b) knowing that the knowledge and skills acquired may be used to carry out a terrorist act, commits an offence and shall, upon conviction, be liable to imprisonment for life.

217G. any person who— (a) harbours or conceals another person; commits an offence and shall, upon conviction, be liable to imprisonment for life, where the person harbours or conceals another person committing terrorist acts knowing or having reasonable grounds to believe that the other person— (i) has carried out terrorist act; (ii) intends to carry out a terrorist act; or (iii) is a member of a terrorist organization.

217G. any person who— (b) prevents, hinders or interferes with the arrest of another person, commits an offence and shall, upon conviction, be liable to imprisonment for life, where the person prevents, hinders or interferes with the arrest of another person committing terrorist acts knowing or having reasonable grounds to believe that the other person— (i) has carried out terrorist act; (ii) intends to carry out a terrorist act; or (iii) is a member of a terrorist organization.

217H any person who knowingly offers to provide or provides a weapon to— (c) any other person for use by that other person to carry out a terrorist act, commits an offence and shall, upon conviction, be liable to imprisonment for life.

217I. any person who— (a) commits an offence under this chapter in another country; may be tried and punished in Malawi as if the offence was wholly committed within the republic.

217I. any person who— (b) while being in Malawi, carries out or aids or abets the carrying out of an offence under this chapter in another country, may be tried and punished in Malawi as if the offence was wholly committed within the republic."
