(Pakistan 2020)_01,IM_PREVENTION,False,,True,1.0,"5. Other Obligations of the Social Media Companies.- A Social Media Company Shall;- (e) shall remove, suspend or disable access to such account, online content of citizens of Pakistan residing outside its territorial boundaries and posts on online content that are involved in spreading of fake news or defamation and violates or affects the religious, cultural, ethnic, or national security sensitivities of Pakistan.

7. Blocking of Online System.- (1) In case a Social Media Company fails to abide by the provision of these Rules, the National Coordinator may issue instructions for blocking of the entire Online System, Social Media Application or services or OTTA owned or managed or run by the said Social Media Company."
