(Algeria 2006)_01,C_EXPRESS_ORDER,True,1.0,True,1.0,"Art. 65 bis 14. Officers or agents of the judicial police authorized under Article 65 bis 11 may, without being criminally responsible: acquire, possess, transport, deliver or hand over substances, goods, products, documents or information drawn from the commission of these offences or serving for the commission of these offences.

Art. 65 bis 14. Officers or agents of the judicial police authorized under Article 65 bis 11 may, without being criminally responsible: use or place at the disposal of the persons delivering these offences means of a legal or financial nature as well as means of transport, deposit, lodging, conservation and telecommunications."
