(Algeria 2006)_01,IM_PREVENTION,False,,True,1.0,"Art. 65 bis 9. The judicial police officer authorized or appointed draws up a report of each interception, capture and recording of correspondences, as well as of those concerning the installation of the technical device and the operations of capture, fixation and audio-visual recording. The report indicates the dates and times when these operations began and when they ended."
