5. (2) An enforcement officer must, where a gathering takes place in contravention of subsection (1) —
(a) orderthe persons atthe gathering to disperse immediately;

Prohibition of gatherings
5. (2) An enforcement officer must, where a gathering takes place in contravention of subsection (1) —
(b) if they refuse to disperse, take appropriate action, including (subject to the Criminal Procedure and Evidence Act) arrest and detention."
