(Algeria 1995)_01,C_EXPRESS_OBSCENE,True,1.0,True,1.0,"Art. 87. bis 3. — Whoever creates, founds, organizes or directs any association, body, group or organization whose purpose or activities fall under the provisions of Article 87 bis of this ordinance, is punished by life imprisonment.

Art. 87. bis 3. — Any membership or participation, in any form whatsoever, in the associations, bodies, groups or organizations referred to in the above paragraph, with knowledge of their purpose or activities, is punished by imprisonment for a term of ten (10) to twenty (20) years."
