(Algeria 1995)_01,C_EXPRESS_REPUTATION,True,1.0,True,1.0,"Art. 87. bis 4. — Whoever praises, encourages or finances, by any means whatsoever, the acts referred to in this section, is punished by imprisonment for a term of five (5) to ten (10) years and by a fine of 100,000 DA to 500,000 DA.

Art. 87. bis 5. — Whoever knowingly reproduces or disseminates documents, printed materials or recordings that praise the acts referred to in this section, is punished by imprisonment for a term of five (5) to ten (10) years and by a fine of 100,000 DA to 500,000 DA."
