(El Salvador 2024)_01,GOV_OVERSIGHT,True,1.0,True,1.0,"Art. 21.- Very serious infractions. The subjects to whom this law applies shall be considered to commit the following very serious infractions: a) To submit, outside the deadline, the reports or information related to cybersecurity and information security that are required by the competent authority, when such information is related to an incident or necessary for its management."
