(Authorship and participation)
2. In periodical publications, news agencies and websites respond successively: b) The director of the periodical, news agency or website or manager, in the case of unsigned writings or images or if the author is not liable and does not reside in Angola, if he has not exonerated himself in the manner provided for in the previous paragraph;

